WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:05.920
At each order cutoff, start on Ordering → Store Order.

2
00:00:05.920 --> 00:00:11.724
Type the copies the store wants for its shelves. Each number saves as you type.

3
00:00:11.724 --> 00:00:16.029
Customers shows what customers reserved. Copies is the total sent to the distributor.

4
00:00:16.029 --> 00:00:23.623
Then open Place Order. It lists every title to order, cutoff by cutoff.

5
00:00:23.623 --> 00:00:26.782
Pick one cutoff…

6
00:00:26.782 --> 00:00:33.080
…and Lunar or PRH, for the file to upload or paste on their site.

7
00:00:33.080 --> 00:00:39.861
Lunar gets a file for its Upload FOC Edits page. PRH gets lines to paste into its cart.

8
00:00:39.861 --> 00:00:42.369
Once the order is placed on their site, mark the cutoff ordered here.
